config FOTA_CONFIRM
	bool "FOTA confirm transport interface (stub)"
	help
	  Exposes the fota_confirm_transport_api vtable header for transports
	  that confirm firmware update completion on sensor nodes.
	  No implementation is provided; this is a placeholder for future
	  wireless confirmation support (LoRa, BLE). See ADR-014.
